ition that existed."}, {"lit": "terrible", "meaning": "millteanach: terrible, awful", "ctx": "Describes the drought."}, {"lit": "there", "meaning": "ann: there, in it", "ctx": "Says the heat and drought existed."}, {"lit": "in the", "meaning": "i + an: in the (form: sa)", "ctx": "Introduces the season."}, {"lit": "summer", "meaning": "samhradh: summer", "ctx": "Says when the heat and drought happened."}, {"lit": "and", "meaning": "agus: and", "ctx": "Joins this to the effect on grass."}, {"lit": "put", "meaning": "cuir: put (past tense: chuir)", "ctx": "Part of chuir isteach ar, affected."}, {"lit": "they", "meaning": "siad: they", "ctx": "Refers to the heat and drought."}, {"lit": "that", "meaning": "sin: that", "ctx": "Emphasises those conditions."}, {"lit": "in", "meaning": "isteach: in, inside", "ctx": "Part of chuir isteach ar, affected."}, {"lit": "on", "meaning": "ar: on", "ctx": "Completes the phrase chuir isteach ar."}, {"lit": "growth", "meaning": "fás: growth (lenited: fhás)", "ctx": "The thing affected was the growth."}, {"lit": "the", "meaning": "an: the", "ctx": "Defines the grass."}, {"lit": "grass", "meaning": "féar: grass (genitive: féir, lenited: fhéir)", "ctx": "Completes growth of the grass."}, {"lit": "under", "meaning": "faoi: under", "ctx": "With láthair, means at present."}, {"lit": "presence", "meaning": "láthair: presence, place", "ctx": "In faoi láthair, meaning at present."}, {"lit": "is", "meaning": "bí: to be (present tense: tá)", "ctx": "States the farmers are worried."}, {"lit": "worry", "meaning": "imní: worry, anxiety", "ctx": "The feeling the farmers have."}, {"lit": "great", "meaning": "mór: big, great (lenited: mhór)", "ctx": "Describes the worry as great."}, {"lit": "on", "meaning": "ar: on", "ctx": "In Irish, worry is on someone."}, {"lit": "the", "meaning": "an: the (plural form: na)", "ctx": "Defines the farmers."}, {"lit": "farmers", "meaning": "feirmeoir: farmer (plural: feirmeoirí)", "ctx": "The people who are worried."}, 